  "helpFaqBotGreeting": "Hi! I'm MediMitra Help. Ask me anything about symptom checking, voice input, outbreak alerts, clinics, login, or privacy.\n\nNote: This is not medical advice. If you have a medical emergency, contact local emergency services.",
  "helpFaqSuggestionCheckSymptoms": "How do I check symptoms?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionVoiceSymptoms": "How do voice symptoms work?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionOutbreakAlert": "What is outbreak alert?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionNearbyClinics": "How to find nearby clinics?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionOtpLogin": "How does OTP login work?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionDataSafe": "Is my data safe?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionGuestMode": "Can I use the app without login?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionChangeLanguage": "How to change language?",
  "helpFaqSuggestionDarkMode": "How to enable dark mode?",
  "helpFaqReplySymptomChecking": "To check symptoms:\n1) Open Chat / Symptom Checker\n2) Type your symptoms (or use voice)\n3) Answer follow-up questions\n\nMediMitra will show likely causes and next steps. For severe symptoms (chest pain, trouble breathing, fainting), seek urgent care.",
  "helpFaqReplyVoiceSymptoms": "Voice symptoms: tap the microphone, speak your symptoms clearly, and the app converts it to text for analysis.\n\nTips: speak one symptom at a time, use simple words (\"fever\", \"cough\"), and allow microphone permission when asked.",
  "helpFaqReplyOutbreakAlert": "Outbreak alert helps you see if certain symptoms are trending in your area. It's based on anonymized, aggregated symptom patterns and is meant for awareness (not diagnosis).\n\nYou can view outbreak insights from the Outbreak section.",
  "helpFaqReplyNearbyClinics": "Nearby clinics: open the Clinic Locator to see clinics around you.\n\nMake sure Location permission is enabled. If you prefer, you can also search by area/city (if available on your build).",
  "helpFaqReplyOtpLogin": "OTP login: enter your 10-digit mobile number and we send a verification OTP. Enter the 6-digit OTP to proceed.\n\nIf you don't receive it, wait for the resend timer and try again. Also confirm network/SMS permissions.",
  "helpFaqReplyGuestMode": "Guest mode lets you explore the app without signing in. Some features that save to your profile (like personalized settings) may be limited until you log in.",
  "helpFaqReplyPrivacy": "Your profile data (like name/age/gender/conditions) is stored securely for your account to personalize your experience. We do not want you to share sensitive info in chat.\n\nFor exact details, check Privacy Policy (in the app).",
  "helpFaqReplyChangeLanguage": "You can change language from Profile → Language.",
  "helpFaqReplyDarkMode": "Dark mode: go to Profile → Dark Mode and toggle it on/off. Your choice is saved and works across the whole app.",
  "helpFaqReplyContactSupport": "Contact support: open Contact Us and send your message. Include screenshots and steps if possible.",
  "helpFaqReplyFallback": "I can help with: symptom checking, voice input, outbreak alerts, clinic locator, OTP login, privacy, language, and dark mode.\n\nTry one of these: \"How do I check symptoms?\", \"How to find nearby clinics?\", \"Is my data safe?\""
